1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:05,156
The standard jelly is M S medium, from Murashige and Skoog.

2
00:00:05,156 --> 00:00:07,825
Mineral salts, big and small.

3
00:00:07,825 --> 00:00:13,984
Sucrose for energy, because the cultures cannot feed themselves by photosynthesis.

4
00:00:13,984 --> 00:00:15,104
Vitamins.

5
00:00:15,104 --> 00:00:16,458
Agar to set it.

6
00:00:16,458 --> 00:00:22,070
And, most important, plant hormones: an auxin and a cytokinin.

